Authors of OpenAlloy
====================

Everton Vilhena Cardoso
    Author and maintainer. Design, implementation, documentation, translations
    (English and Brazilian Portuguese), testing on real hardware (HyperX Alloy
    Origins Core HP 03f0:098f, firmware 21.16) and releases.

There are no other contributors at this time.

OpenAlloy also builds on the work of other free software projects. They are
not authors of OpenAlloy; they are credited, with their licenses, in THANKS.
